    "content": "<p>These patch notes detail changes for the War Robots: Frontiers build available from June 7, 2023.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>BUGS FIXED</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Fixed crashes when launching the game on integrated AMD Radeon and AMD Radeon RX 400/500 Series.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>OTHER IMPROVEMENTS</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>Added pop-up window at launch for systems and hardware that do not support DirectX 12.</li>\r\n</ul>",
